    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BOOKISH: I don't think they are masks.\nBEAUTY: I don't think they're Hitchhiking Girls either.\nBOOKISH: Ghouls, you fucking moron. Not Girls. Though I wish they were hitchhiking girls. Sexy, skimpily clad hitchhiking girls--",
      "SISSY: What's wrong with you, Justice? You do remember where we're going, don't you?\nMISSY: That we do have a job to do?\nJUSTICE: They're just gonna tag along for a few miles. They won't get in the way, I promise. Please?\nSISSY: Fine--they can ride with us. But they're so out of here before we get to Boulder.",
      "CHRISSY: What the fuck are we gonna do now?\nSISSY: Shut up, I'm thinking.",
      "JUSTICE: You are so gay.\nSISSY: Once we're inside, I want complete silence. Missy whipped this up. It counts our decibel level. If it goes into the red--alarm, we're dead. …\nSISSY: Justice! Move your ass!",
      "CHRISSY: Boom Box!\nSISSY: I can't believe it. Months of planning and it's all blown by a fucking fart.\nJUSTICE: We can't just leave them like this! That alarm's gonna bring the cops here any minute!\nSISSY: That was always the plan, Justice! They take the heat off of is long enough until we can get out of town!"
    ]
  },
